    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκοπ-ίαστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
